# 🧭 Overview

**Blind AI** is a real-time assistive vision system that combines multiple
computer-vision and AI capabilities into one modular assistant.

Instead of relying on a single model, the system uses specialized perception
modules and combines their outputs through a **fusion and prioritization layer**.

```text
                    CAMERA
                       │
                       ▼
              ┌─────────────────┐
              │  Vision Input   │
              └────────┬────────┘
                       │
        ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
        ▼              ▼              ▼
   Object Detection   OCR       Depth Estimation
        │              │              │
        ├──────────────┼──────────────┤
        ▼              ▼              ▼
   Face Recognition  Gesture     Traffic Light
        │              │              │
        ├──────────────┼──────────────┤
        ▼              ▼              ▼
     Emotion       Currency      Navigation
        │              │              │
        └──────────────┼──────────────┘
                       ▼
              ┌─────────────────┐
              │  Fusion Engine  │
              └────────┬────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
              ┌─────────────────┐
              │ Priority Logic  │
              └────────┬────────┘
                       │
             ┌─────────┴─────────┐
             ▼                   ▼
       Voice Assistant      Groq AI
             │                   │
             └─────────┬─────────┘
                       ▼
                TEXT TO SPEECH
                       │
                       ▼
                 🔊 AUDIO OUTPUT
